WEBVTT

00:42:58.316 --> 00:43:02.076
in the United States and Europe
that will resist direct decoupling.

00:43:02.436 --> 00:43:07.156
Despite the fact that there are
these more incremental moves

00:43:07.196 --> 00:43:09.436
towards friendsourcing and insourcing

00:43:09.476 --> 00:43:12.076
because, you know,
Chinese labor is more expensive,

00:43:12.116 --> 00:43:17.476
you don’t need as much labor
to get capital moving,

00:43:17.516 --> 00:43:19.636
given robotics

00:43:19.676 --> 00:43:22.716
and big data, deep learning
all of those things.

00:43:23.396 --> 00:43:27.276
But I do think that the Russia conflict

00:43:27.316 --> 00:43:31.956
risks a level of second-order decoupling.